ABSTRACT:
The Weekly Meal Planner & Grocery List Generator is a basic Java console application designed to make weekly meal planning easier and more organized.The program 
 lets users enter meals and ingredients for each day of the week, stores them in a simple structure, and automatically generates a combined grocery list by merging
repeated ingredients. By using beginner‑friendly Java concepts like classes, ArrayLists, HashMaps, loops, and  user input, the project shows how simple code 
can solve real everyday problems. The goal is to reduce planning mistakes, avoid ingredient mismatches, and help users shop with a clear,focused list. This project 
also serves as a practical way to learn core Java fundamentals through a real‑world workflow.
SETUP & EXECUTION:
1.Install JDK
2.Open any IDE
3.Create the 4 classes (Meal, MealPlanner, GroceryListGenerator, Main)
4.Paste the code
5.Run Main
6.Enter meals + ingredients for all 7 days
7.App prints weekly plan + merged grocery list
